  "body": "Chrome implements out-of-process `iframe` elements, but using a model that's not readily apparent from the HTML Standard. Although technically it's not supposed to be observable, it might still be worth it to refactor the HTML Standard to use that kind of model to make it easier for other implementations and to not accidentally break invariants.",
